{"ref":"BDB, דִּמְנָה","hw":"דִּמְנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דִּמְנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Levitical city in Zebulun <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:35\" href=\"/Joshua.21.35\">Jos 21:35</a> (but read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמֹּנָה</span> +; cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:62\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.62\">1 Ch 6:62</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:13\" href=\"/Joshua.19.13\">Jos 19:13</a>, and v. Di).","next":"BDB, מַדְמֵן","prev":"BDB, דֹּ֫מֶן"}